gh the cover of narrow  lanes avoiding the wide open ranges but  no matter what you'll find yourself  squared off with the Titan you need to  close that gap as soon as possible and  get in there Grill strive for agility  and speed consider adding turbo engine  for a third - and parry with your sword  block when you run out of speed if  you're close enough sending off an arc  wave will stun a tightening giving you  ample time to constantly circle your foe  swinging and if you got that sword core  ready you're golden  finally there's North Star just like  Ronan she lacks armor meaning you two  are practicing guerrilla tactics only  the difference is you live for distance  you're a sniper with a plus you can  hover charge up that railgun and hit  that VTOL four shots that no one else  can make  do hammer tightens with a fully charged  rail gunshot but for pilots they don't  deserve it  it's a great Titan for hunting pilots  and CTF but again you are not meant for  the frontlines North Star has  practically no defense so when a Titan  is closing in you drop that tether trap  to slow them down and send off a cluster  missile better yet  tack on the enhanced payload kit to make  that missile even more lethal because  all you can really do in a retreat is  attack however when your flight Corps is  ready shall them  show them off  and there you have it some pointers and  mastering the lineup of mechs and  titanfall - what's your favorite of the  lot and if you have any tips or pointers  on them do leave them in the comment  section below  thanks for watching and for all things  titanfall stay tuned to games bye  you

